0,Mbandja language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mbandja_language,"Mbandja language ... Mbandja (Banja, Mbanza) is the largest of the Banda languages. There are 350,000 speakers in DRC, 10,000 in the Republic of Congo, and an unknown number in CAR.",Mbandja,Niger-Congo
1,Banda languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Banda_languages,"Banda is a family of Ubangian languages spoken by the Banda people of Central Africa. Banda languages are distributed in the Central African Republic, Democratic Republic of the Congo, and South Sudan.",Mbandja,Niger-Congo
